    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Welcome to Hopp</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_text">An honest, open podcast player: no account, no tracking. Your subscriptions stay on your device.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_subscribe_title">Subscribe to shows</string>
    <string name="onboarding_subscribe_text">Under Discover you search the Podcast Index, paste a feed address or import your subscriptions from another app as OPML. Each show can be looked at before you subscribe.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_library_title">Your library</string>
    <string name="onboarding_library_text">Home shows what is new, what to continue and what runs at your shows. The library holds your shows, up next and downloads — new episodes download on Wi-Fi by themselves.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_v4v_title">Value for value</string>
    <string name="onboarding_v4v_text">Podcasts live on their listeners. A boost sends sats — bitcoin over Lightning — straight to the people behind a show, with a message, split the way the show sets it. Streaming sends a few sats per minute while you listen, only if you switch it on. Sovereigncast shows also let you bring episodes out sooner and vote on topics.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_wallet_title">Connect your wallet</string>
    <string name="onboarding_wallet_text">For boosts, connect your Lightning wallet over Nostr Wallet Connect (NWC) — Alby Hub, Primal, Coinos and others offer it. A daily budget keeps it in check. Without a wallet, everything else works just the same.</string>
    <string name="sc_info_title">What Sovereigncast brings</string>
    <string name="sc_info_intro">This show runs on Sovereigncast — the open, self-hosted platform its makers produce it with. In Hopp it brings extras no other app shows:</string>
    <string name="sc_info_rb">Release Boosting: your sats bring the next episode out sooner.</string>
    <string name="sc_info_b2u">Boost2Unlock: listeners unlock special episodes together.</string>
    <string name="sc_info_suggestions">Topic suggestions: see what others want to hear, and vote for free.</string>
    <string name="sc_info_boosts">The community's boosts: this month's top boosts and the all-time ranking.</string>
    <string name="sc_info_clips">Clips that unlock halfway to the goal.</string>
    <string name="sc_info_trust">Hopp checks with the show's own instance that the show really belongs there before it shows any of this.</string>
    <string name="sc_info_more">More about Sovereigncast</string>
    <string name="sc_info_url">https://sovereigncast.space/</string>
