    <string name="nostr_entry_none">Optional — vote as a person, comment later</string>
    <string name="nostr_intro">An optional identity on Nostr, the open network many podcast apps share. With it, Hopp greets you by your name, and your votes on Sovereigncast shows count once per person, on every device. Comments follow. Without it, Hopp works exactly as before.</string>
    <string name="nostr_permanent">What you publish with this identity — your name now, comments later — is public and stays on Nostr for good. Nothing published there can be taken back.</string>
